{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-10","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与平方与立方","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be not square, neither will any other be square except the third from the unit and all those which leave out one. And, if the number after the unit be not cube, neither will any other be cube except the fourth from the unit and all those which leave out two.","book":9,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","contentId":"euclid-9-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28704ca8b9e2bf2d6857f14494bed1e9d68eaaa3915ca539537dddfaafa0001f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-10.statement","euclid-9-10.construction.1","euclid-9-10.proof.1","euclid-9-10.proof.2","euclid-9-10.proof.3","euclid-9-10.proof.4","euclid-9-10.proof.5","euclid-9-10.proof.6","euclid-9-10.proof.7","euclid-9-10.proof.8","euclid-9-10.proof.9","euclid-9-10.proof.10","euclid-9-10.proof.11","euclid-9-10.proof.12","euclid-9-10.proof.13","euclid-9-10.proof.14","euclid-9-10.proof.15","euclid-9-10.proof.16","euclid-9-10.conclusion","euclid-9-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cd89b6b07053bb345fdcbd0baf7f723acc6e779f046ae3a9b39ee52b2a054cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, and the number after the unit be not square, neither will any other be square except the third from the unit and all those which leave out one. And, if the number after the unit be not cube, neither will any other be cube except the fourth from the unit and all those which leave out two."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的号码是连比例,单位之后的数字不是平方数,那么除单位之后的第三个数字和所有遗漏的数字之外,其他数字也不会是平方数。如果单位之后的数字不是立方体,那么除单位之后的第四个数字和所有遗漏两个数字的,其他数字也不会是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dda319379f098ba5cd811cd826eaeaaa72ad6574577a951ab092b924e00abe2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, E, F, beginning from an unit and in continued proportion, and let A, the number after the unit, not be square; I say that neither will any other be square except the third from the unit ltand those which leave out onegt."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们尽可能多地多地数,A,B,C,D,E,F,从单位和连比例开始,A,单位之后的数字不是平方数;我说,除单位和1格之外,除第三个数字外,任何其他数字都不会是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29818661c91114c836bbfee7f5655ac5ad37c8313402d81ac2e37920c7980611","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let C be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,C是平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"367fbbd103ac55a72b3674e586ffe34962d3b0b613c28cc1803fe8e46c526fdc","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But B is also square; [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)] [therefore B, C have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number]."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是 B 也是平方数，因此 B 与 C 之比等于一个平方数与另一个平方数之比。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2acf8a481a15e89db879a696706f033e1eee8e5fc6d64d7df75961007329f75a","citations":["euclid-8-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as B is to C, so is A to B; therefore A, B have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; [so that A, B are similar plane numbers]. [[VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26), converse]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B比C等于A比B,因此A比B,平方数比平方数比相似平面数,B比A比B,平方数比平方数。 [因此,A,B是相似平面数]；B 与 C 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [ [VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26)"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0d99427fa7db561d452d2d1820afbae20e8a45ebe32235b7dda4c1fe6b89e49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And B is square; therefore A is also square: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B是平方数,A也是平方数,这与假设相反。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aecd36a2a9523e85dd69a328b811601ead87e34dce94f54c0544368d844c100","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is not square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C不是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"378e0f2b2f28b367627f3e0f2e52687ce4bc3848c0899fef35806d1dd9e02227","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other of the numbers square except the third from the unit and those which leave out one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除单位和平方数数字中的第三个之外,平方数数字中也没有任何其他数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"290bf568462f2e432f5627a772a17e0a7b9c2a3c77023f97b31084f724aa1ca6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A not be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让A不是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cafc65ace3e25e40054546a8285ca668ab7d2a4e5df619b2e53853a0e1953b12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that neither will any other be cube except the fourth from the unit and those which leave out two."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说除了单位的第四张和剩下的两张之外,任何其他的都不可能是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec8c1e341910a9b1a1fc6052fbab58187ba182af58765172657f02d08828a4eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let D be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,D是立方体"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6e7a749d2f71ebf8dae44eaa849f136078c17a55d7e07f0839458d512ca3809","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now C is also cube; for it is fourth from the unit. [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在C也是立方体,因为它是单位的第四。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e74166b389ad5b182b039726365c38fdee8da968721792ba271231e6a0d24774","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as C is to D, so is B to C; therefore B also has to C the ratio which a cube has to a cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C对D的比等于B对C的比,因此B对C的比也等于立方体对立方体的比；C 与 D 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62820a17b2763d868f2490e9de0e5ac4b8c692af4b1e27f0171b8abef41697ea","citations":["euclid-8-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And C is cube; therefore B is also cube. [[VIII. 25](/principles/euclid-8-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C是立方体, 因此B也是立方体。 [[VIII. 25](/principles/euclid-8-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8214895b48e03fa6abc191b8d503dd072c8b72506da754949807c47bdb1e414","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as the unit is to A, so is A to B, and the unit measures A according to the units in it, therefore A also measures B according to the units in itself; therefore A by multiplying itself has made the cube number B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从此,单位对A的比等于A对B的比,单位对整除对A的比则等于单位对单位,因此,根据单位本身,A对整除对B,B;因此,A乘以本身,使立方数对B的比达到了立方数对B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcdddea5f0b45048acc1b9a4411bb8421e17abd90fc4f8a6ac870d78a5820fa0","citations":["euclid-9-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if a number by multiplying itself make a cube number, it is also itself cube. [[IX. 6](/principles/euclid-9-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果一个乘以乘以本身的数值, 就会形成立方数, 它本身也成了立方体。 [[IX. 6](/principles/euclid-9-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a5b1e019a45d62aa6395e589692decda34923ae152f7daf504c5572f3fdec29","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A is also cube: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A也是立方体:这与假设相悖。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"359f3c9e623227462c5a3dfd740f077a2ff5a1bc0362df7ad33ee5df4e22cd22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D is not cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以D不是立方体"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db0591b88ae6d5865b1b5e2813e21d3c74219abd5877831ee532f8131a1fcae5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other of the numbers cube except the fourth from the unit and those which leave out two. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除单位中的第四个和排除2号的立方体之外,这两个数字中也没有任何其他立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-10.source","contentId":"euclid-9-10","revisionId":"euclid-9-10@raw-28704ca8b9e2bf2d","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"615365601d1364101cda2f1db54f8177b9e7d35ec9406ce2afc2a176abac437f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-10.proof.2","euclid-9-10.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"IX. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-8-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-10.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-8-25:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-10.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-25","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 25"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-10.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"IX. 6"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-8:explicit","id":"euclid-9-8","book":9,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"等比数列中的平方数与立方数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-8-26:explicit","id":"euclid-8-26","book":8,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平方与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-8-25:explicit","id":"euclid-8-25","book":8,"number":25,"kind":"proposition","title":"立方数的比例结构","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-9-6:explicit","id":"euclid-9-6","book":9,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
